[Name] PyCairo
[Summary] Python 3 bindings for the Cairo 2D graphics library (module cairo)
[License] MIT
[Homepage] https://pycairo.readthedocs.io
[Description] PyCairo is a set of Python bindings for the Cairo graphics library. This 1.20.1 build targets Python 3.11 and is a dependency of PyGObject's gi.cairo integration and of Lutris.
